🟠 invoicer in billing (prod-eu-1) cannot start because secret stripe-api does not exist. It fails with "secret "stripe-api" not found". Every error mentions it. All of its dependents are failing. Fix in: deployment/invoicer → container app → envFrom.secretRef (secret stripe-api). To list the keys of the Secret the pods depend on, run kubectl describe secret stripe-api -n billing
Checked: both replicas fail, on 2 nodes.
